OL,3,GNEWSABattening down the hatches before
OL,4,AStorm Austen
OL,5,
OL,6,FBosses at The Watering Hole bar on
OL,7,FPerranporth Beach in Cornwall, said
OL,8,Fthey were taking extra precautions
OL,9,Fafter the venue suffered damage during
OL,10,FStorm Goretti in January.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
